        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Television series: Ex on the Beach (series 4), Geordie Shore\n- People: Scotty T, Lewis Good\n- Organizations: MTV\n- Places: Newcastle upon Tyne, England\n- Topics: British reality television, Jersey Shore adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Geordie Shore is a British reality television series that was first broadcast on 24 May 2011 on MTV.\n- Geordie Shore is based in Newcastle upon Tyne, England, and is the British version of the American show Jersey Shore.\n- Ex on the Beach (series 4), a British television programme, began airing on MTV on 19 January 2016.\n- Ex on the Beach (series 4) concluded on 8 March 2016 after eight episodes.\n- The cast of Ex on the Beach (series 4) included Geordie Shore star Scotty T and Judge Geordie guest Lewis Good.",
